{"name":"Minotaur Skeleton","size":"large","type":"undead","tag":"","alignment":"lawful evil","hitDice":"6","armorName":"natural armor","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":2,"otherArmorDesc":"12 (natural armor)","speed":"40","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":false,"customSpeed":true,"hpText":"67 (9d10 + 18)","speedDesc":"12m","strPoints":"18","dexPoints":"11","conPoints":"15","intPoints":"6","wisPoints":"8","chaPoints":"5","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"60","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"1","customCr":"2 (450 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The minotaur skeleton can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The minotaur skeleton regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the minotaur skeleton can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the minotaur skeleton can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The minotaur skeleton can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the minotaur skeleton's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the minotaur skeleton's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the minotaur skeleton dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Charge","desc":"If the [MON] moves at least 3m straight toward a target and then hits it with a Gore attack on the same turn, the target takes an extra [2D8] piercing damage. If the target is a creature, it must succeed on a DC 14 Strength saving throw or be pushed up to 3m away knocked prone."}],"actions":[{"name":"Greataxe","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 1m, one target. _Hit:_ [STR 1D12] slashing damage."},{"name":"Gore","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 1m, one target. _Hit:_ [STR 2D8] piercing damage."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[],"skills":[],"damagetypes":[],"specialdamage":[{"name":"Bludgeoning (x2)","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"}],"conditions":[{"name":"exhaustion"},{"name":"poisoned"}],"languages":[{"name":"Abyssal","speaks":false}],"understandsBut":"can't speak","shortName":"minotaur skeleton","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":0,"damage":[]}